\\\  & =\\alpha \\beta (b\\cdot a)-9.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, using that the dot product is symmetric, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\alpha \\beta (b\\cdot a)-9 & =\\alpha \\beta (a\\cdot b)-9.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute the values for $\\alpha \\beta $ and $a\\cdot b:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\alpha \\beta (a\\cdot b)-9 & =(-5)\\cdot (3)-9 \\\\  & =-15-9 \\\\  & =-24\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-40049/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1fba8401-2da1-50f2-8e96-84cbe06d95fc"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-40049"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-39203/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" :answer/id #uuid "a5276852-d117-5398-8e8f-c22f1ce06f18" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-39203/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" :answer/id #uuid "f912d2ec-a9f6-53a5-9dd7-af62ba1b92aa" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-39203/selection/1f1f2fe9df6485d5cdc7916416b2f79699d874348406e639d5daec02cb2e57e6" :answer/id #uuid "7d01f756-8551-5842-bbf1-3f80189be14d" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-39203/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" :answer/id #uuid "ac8fdb0e-e4db-56e5-bef4-1bea565659f0" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-39203/selection/03b99debc8e9534f2364927a2cf1eba83bddd906503dea5d13395ce906a45ab9" :answer/id #uuid "b2140f62-47ac-539a-9423-09a170ae82c2" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "None of the statements are true" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-39203/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "233ad840-2e99-5b7e-86a7-cd882deea2d0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-39203/selection/03b99debc8e9534f2364927a2cf1eba83bddd906503dea5d13395ce906a45ab9" :answer-field/choices ["q-39203/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" "q-39203/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" "q-39203/selection/1f1f2fe9df6485d5cdc7916416b2f79699d874348406e639d5daec02cb2e57e6" "q-39203/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" "q-39203/selection/03b99debc8e9534f2364927a2cf1eba83bddd906503dea5d13395ce906a45ab9"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-39203" :question/id #uuid "a36b9f56-d20b-5fa5-91b5-434374e4c66c" :question/math-academy-id "q-39203" :question/problem "Suppose $(a+b)\\cdot a=0$, where $a\\ne 0.$ Which of the following statements are true? \n\n- $b\\cdot a>0$\n- $b\\cdot a=0$\n- $a\\cdot a=0$" :question/worked-solution "Let's analyze each statement in turn.\n\n- Statements I and II are false. Simplifying the expression $(a+b)\\cdot a=0$, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(a+b)\\cdot a & =0 \\\\ a\\cdot a+b\\cdot a & =0 \\\\ b\\cdot a & =-a\\cdot a\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \nSince $a\\ne 0$ implies that $a\\cdot a>0$, we obtain that $-a\\cdot a<0.$\n\n- Statement III is false. Since $a\\ne 0,$ we must have $a\\cdot a>0.$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that none of the statements are true." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-39203/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "41c2d289-8df5-551b-9501-3a762c67386f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-39203"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-40116/selection/70aef029925b027ae46cea6bcdd6130ba485f06154ccd6618a6036d2b3b57776" :answer/id #uuid "93648a40-369c-5ed0-80b9-51c4fce32f8a" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "All the listed" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-40116/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73